[en.FOCUS_C12_MARBLE_PIE_APARTMENT]
Marble Pie Apartment

[en.FOCUS_C12_MARBLE_PIE_APARTMENT_desc]
Under the ingenious design of Marble Pie, a stone apartment building that could be rapidly constructed according to templates while also meeting the living needs of ponies would be promoted throughout the entire autonomous territory. This would swiftly provide many homeless ponies with suitable shelters, without having to endure the bitter cold of the slums any longer.These unique buildings would be named after her.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MARBLE_PIE_APARTMENT]
大理石公寓

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MARBLE_PIE_APARTMENT_desc]
在派家族的小马玉琪派的巧妙设计下，一种可以按照模板高速搭建，同时又能满足小马起居需要的石质公寓楼将被推广到整个自治领。这将以迅猛的速度给许多无家可归的小马一个合适的栖身之处，而不用再住在挡不住寒风的贫民窟中。这种奇特的建筑楼将被冠以她的名字。

